{"uid":"modules/bof_delivery.py","name":"bof_delivery.py","qualname":"modules/bof_delivery.py","kind":"module","file":"modules/bof_delivery.py","line":1,"end_line":1309,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"BOF delivery through the lazyaddon beacon clients.","description":"Beacon Object Files discovered in ``bofs/*.yaml`` travel to the target\nexactly as their declaring lazyaddon client describes:\n\n- ``beacon`` (Windows COFF BOFs): the ``bof:url`` command is queued for a\n  connected Windows beacon; it downloads the object from the C2\n  ``/download/bofs/<name>`` endpoint and executes it with its internal\n  COFFLoader.\n- ``blacksandbeacon`` (Linux ELF BOFs): the ``bof:url`` command is queued\n  identically; the beacon downloads the position-independent ELF object\n  and runs it through its ``RunELF`` loader with the datap argument API.\n\nThis module owns the client articulation: it reads the lazyaddon manifests\nto compute install paths and staged binaries, stages BOF objects, builds\nthe delivery command, pushes it to the C2, deploys the client beacon on a\ntarget reached through the atomic exploit bridge, and collects results\nfrom the beacon history. CLI, loop and chains all call these functions.\n\nContracts:\n    - ``BofDeliveryConfig``: paths, timeouts and HTTP knobs.\n    - ``queue_to_beacon``: authenticated C2 push (single shared helper).\n    - ``stage_bof`` / ``stage_client``: staging of BOF objects and the\n      client beacon binary.\n    - ``deploy_client``: deliver the beacon binary onto a target with a\n      live atomic session and wait for the first check-in.\n    - ``run_bof``: queue one BOF command and optionally wait for output.\n    - ``recent_beacons``: snapshot of beacons seen by the C2.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["modules/bof_delivery.py::BofDeliveryConfig","modules/bof_delivery.py::ClientAddon","modules/bof_delivery.py::load_client_addon","modules/bof_delivery.py::staging_dir","modules/bof_delivery.py::stage_bof","modules/bof_delivery.py::stage_client","modules/bof_delivery.py::delivery_command","modules/bof_delivery.py::queue_to_beacon","modules/bof_delivery.py::recent_beacons","modules/bof_delivery.py::wait_for_beacon","modules/bof_delivery.py::c2_reachable","modules/bof_delivery.py::run_bof","modules/bof_delivery.py::run_bof_train","modules/bof_delivery.py::deploy_client","modules/bof_delivery.py::bof_results"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
